sentences.text:
This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the claimants being aggrieved by the judgment dated 02.03.2021 passed by the IV Addl. District Judge and MACT, Tumakuru, sitting at Madhugiri (for short 'the Tribunal')
in MVC No.1395/2018.
